        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric parts of Mini CHP plant
Inventory based on information from manufacturer (Ecopower 1997;
UUID: 033c2e16-6df5-3977-a829-869d40fa6dab
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the energy and water needed for production.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions.
Technology: Specific manufacturer (Ecopower in Switzerland)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_033c2e16-6df5-3977-a829-869d40fa6dab.xml</text>
